%li.jpost#ghacker
  .title.expandable
    %a.more-details
      %i.fa.fa-plus
    %h3.name Product Marketing / Growth Hacker

  .details
    .details-container
      %p.location
        Mountain View, CA

      %p We're looking for someone who is interested in helping drive the growth of Nitrous.IO by creating clear, compelling and targeted content about the Nitrous.IO platform and its powerful features.

      %p The ideal candidate will have previous experience in helping establish a massive brand through targeted communication to potential users.  The candidate will also be a proficient programmer, as much of the content will require knowledge of scripting languages, setting up development environments, and configuring software.

      %h4 Responsibilities
      %p.reqs
        %ul
          %li Ideating and creating new tutorials for blog.nitrous.io and our new content portal
          %li Authoring, editing and publishing video tutorials on how to use the Nitrous.IO platform to improve development in various capacities
          %li Authoring help articles, co-branded marketing posts, company newsletters and product announcements.

      %h4 Requirements
      %p.reqs
        %ul
          %li Experience with video recording and editing software
          %li Keen attention to detail, obsessive over grammar, smooth audio, continuity
          %li Excellent written and verbal communication skills
          %li Some previous coding experience (Ruby, Python, PHP, Javascript)
          %li Experience in a high-tech company driving product marketing and communication

      %p.actions
        To apply, please send us the following:

        %p.reqs
          %ul
            %li Github Profile w/ Code you've written
            %li Links to personal blog or articles you've authored
            %li Links to video content or podcasts you've produced
            %li Links to community profiles like Twitter, Hacker News, Stack Overflow, reddit, etc...
            %li Why you want to change development

      .details-actions
        %p
          = mail_to 'jobs@nitrous.io?subject=Growth%20Hacker', 'Apply for this Job', encode: 'javascript', class: "btn btn-success"
